      "title": "Read me - files",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## P-H3-Image - files\n| folder | file | size |\n|---|---|---|\n| diffusion_models | **p-h3-image_int8_convrot** (best quality) | 21.2 GB |\n| diffusion_models | p-h3-image_w4a8 (smaller cards) | 13.4 GB |\n| text_encoders | **p-h3-image_text_encoder_int8_convrot** | 5.1 GB |\n| text_encoders | p-h3-image_text_encoder_w4a8 (smaller cards) | 3.6 GB |\n| text_encoders | p-h3-image_prompt_upsampler_int8_convrot (optional) | 9.7 GB |\n| vae | p-h3-image_vae_int8_convrot | 3.1 GB |\n\nAll `.safetensors`, from **PrunaAI/P-H3-Image-Comfy** on Hugging Face. Built-in nodes: update ComfyUI to the latest version (tested on 0.45.0). rgthree for the toggle panel and the prompt switch.\nLicence: MiniMax H3 Community License - read it on the model page before you use it.\nWorkflow by TheLocalLab, built on PrunaAI's official workflow."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## P-H3-Image - files\n| folder | file | size |\n|---|---|---|\n| diffusion_models | **p-h3-image_int8_convrot** (best quality) | 21.2 GB |\n| diffusion_models | p-h3-image_w4a8 (smaller cards) | 13.4 GB |\n| text_encoders | **p-h3-image_text_encoder_int8_convrot** | 5.1 GB |\n| text_encoders | p-h3-image_text_encoder_w4a8 (smaller cards) | 3.6 GB |\n| text_encoders | p-h3-image_prompt_upsampler_int8_convrot (optional) | 9.7 GB |\n| vae | p-h3-image_vae_int8_convrot | 3.1 GB |\n\nAll `.safetensors`, from **PrunaAI/P-H3-Image-Comfy** on Hugging Face. Built-in nodes: update ComfyUI to the latest version (tested on 0.45.0). rgthree for the toggle panel and the prompt switch.\nLicence: MiniMax H3 Community License - read it on the model page before you use it.\nWorkflow by TheLocalLab, built on PrunaAI's official workflow."
      },
